   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>Prezados,</div><div>Estou tentando inserir no &quot;scatter plot de matriz&quot; (veja o conjunto dados de exemplo,  abaixo) as linhas de correlação entre as variáveis, entretanto não estou conseguindo de um modo mais direto.</div>\r\n\r\n<div>Seria para como usar para cada um dos gráficos o seguinte exemplo:</div><div>#-------</div><div><div>z &lt;- lm(dist ~ speed, data = cars)</div><div>plot(cars)</div><div>abline(z) # equivalent to abline(reg = z) or</div>\r\n\r\n<div>abline(coef = coef(z))</div></div><div>#---------</div><div>Entretanto eu preciso colocar uma reta para cada plot abaixo</div><br clear=\"all\"><div>#DADOS DE EXEMPLO</div><div><div>var_1&lt;-c(0.492077114759013 , 0.836016362765804 , 0.481298430124298 , 0.386469675228 , 0.777098514838144 , 0.617958343820646 , 0.219213913194835 , 0.678557483945042 , 0.423462828854099 , 0.829378235153854 , 0.806068887002766 , 0.337134317029268 , 0.661742311669514 , 0.619118098868057 , 0.788589890813455 , 0.279048688709736 , 0.820936637930572 , 0.247459845617414 , 0.752754796063527 , 0.934190914966166)</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>var_2&lt;-c(0.658414233683847 , 0.605210445823305 , 0.801341124716519 , 1.011018222403 , 0.572025150910094 , 0.836177895660953 , 1.03193629108894 , 0.656809315729027 , 0.949461899587905 , 0.553121786467357 , 0.817865236941146 , 0.925669452041572 , 0.578475899228501 , 0.476615221718288 , 0.571342170684858 , 0.867686931852481 , 0.615533868096807 , 0.926396173911956 , 0.667834629397337 , 0.65446214987638)</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>var_3&lt;-c(0.805190744576976 , 0.00357919884845614 , 0.296429808018729 , 0.147386643337086 , 0.224931408418342 , 0.967352513456717 , 0.88843358354643 , 0.991240894189104 , 0.906759183388203 , 0.635862796101719 , 0.90428285067901 , 0.755293083842844 , 0.484490071190521 , 0.0830997943412513 , 0.66727612237446 , 0.314308791654184 , 0.478725346503779 , 0.885625332361087 , 0.567443900275975 , 0.175529750995338)</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>var_4&lt;-c(1.51875793231285 , 2.08332774568708 , 1.85743044603302 , 1.94252530517918 , 1.70102115019736 , 1.4099218798547 , 1.37410255920602 , 1.63332942855045 , 1.59918963127413 , 1.54217901497363 , 1.39090041665641 , 1.56455567202422 , 1.70518441073333 , 1.96772731408659 , 1.76799247833419 , 1.85562083102216 , 1.81231983166867 , 1.58934006350458 , 1.77421167457209 , 2.01928129901513)</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>data&lt;-data.frame(var_1,var_2,var_3,var_4)</div><div><br></div><div>plot(data,pch=16)</div></div><div><br></div><div>Certo de vossa atenção,</div><div>Atenciosamente,</div><div>Luciano</div><div><br>\r\n\r\n</div><div><br></div>-- <br><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"></blockquote><div>Luciano F. Sgarbi</div><div>Mestrando em Ecologia e Evolução - UFG</div><div>Laboratório de Ecologia de Insetos</div>\r\n\r\n<div>Cel. (62)8174-2262   Lab. (62)3521-1732</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/forum/r-ecologia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/forum/r-ecologia&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244177076000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17-Iwd0Qv3wDWDZn4P_PqF\">https://groups.google.com/d/forum/r-ecologia</a></div><br>\r\n"
